Generate a comprehensive {{ section_name }} section for a {{ product_type }} digital product.

## Section Context
- **Product Title**: {{ title }}
- **Target Audience**: {{ target_audience }}
- **Product Type**: {{ product_type }}
- **Brief**: {{ brief }}
- **Word Count Target**: {{ word_count_target }} words
- **Section Focus**: {{ section_focus }}

## Section Requirements

### Content Focus
{% if section_name == "Introduction" %}
- Hook the reader immediately with a compelling opening
- State the problem or opportunity clearly
- Preview the solution and value proposition
- Establish credibility and authority
- Keep it concise and impactful
{% endif %}

{% if section_name == "Problem Statement" %}
- Clearly define the core problem or challenge
- Explain why this problem matters to the target audience
- Quantify the impact where possible
- Build emotional connection to the pain points
- Set up the need for a solution
{% endif %}

{% if section_name == "Solution Overview" %}
- Present the main solution/approach
- Explain how it addresses the identified problem
- Highlight key benefits and advantages
- Differentiate from existing alternatives
- Build confidence in the solution
{% endif %}

{% if section_name == "Implementation Steps" %}
- Provide detailed, step-by-step instructions
- Include practical examples and use cases
- Add troubleshooting tips and common pitfalls
- Ensure each step is actionable and clear
- Include necessary tools or resources
{% endif %}

{% if section_name == "Examples and Case Studies" %}
- Provide real-world application examples
- Include before/after scenarios where applicable
- Add success stories and testimonials
- Show different use cases and variations
- Demonstrate versatility and effectiveness
{% endif %}

{% if section_name == "Best Practices" %}
- Outline key principles and guidelines
- Include optimization techniques
- Add advanced tips for experienced users
- Cover common mistakes to avoid
- Provide performance optimization advice
{% endif %}

{% if section_name == "Conclusion" %}
- Summarize key takeaways and benefits
- Reinforce the value proposition
- Provide clear next steps and call to action
- Leave the reader motivated and confident
- Include additional resources for continued learning
{% endif %}

### Writing Guidelines
- Use professional, authoritative tone
- Write in clear, accessible language
- Include specific, actionable advice
- Avoid jargon unless explained
- Maintain consistency with Kade persona
- No personal anecdotes or identity disclosure
- Focus on practical value and outcomes

### Structure Requirements
- Start with a strong opening sentence
- Use clear headings and subheadings
- Include bullet points or numbered lists where appropriate
- Add examples and illustrations where helpful
- End with a clear summary or transition

### Quality Standards
- Meet or exceed the target word count of {{ word_count_target }} words
- Provide comprehensive, complete information
- Ensure all content is original and valuable
- Check for grammar, spelling, and formatting
- Verify all instructions are clear and actionable

## Special Instructions for {{ product_type }}

{% if product_type == "pdf_guide" %}
- Focus on comprehensive, in-depth content
- Include detailed explanations and examples
- Provide step-by-step guidance
- Add practical exercises or worksheets if applicable
{% endif %}

{% if product_type == "template_pack" %}
- Emphasize ease of use and customization
- Include clear instructions for each template
- Provide examples of filled templates
- Add tips for adaptation and modification
{% endif %}

{% if product_type == "checklist" %}
- Make items specific and measurable
- Include progress tracking elements
- Add context and usage instructions
- Provide completion criteria
{% endif %}

{% if product_type == "cheat_sheet" %}
- Focus on quick reference information
- Use concise, scannable format
- Include keyboard shortcuts and commands
- Add essential formulas and references
{% endif %}

{% if product_type == "prompt_library" %}
- Provide context for each prompt
- Include usage examples and variations
- Add tips for prompt optimization
- Categorize by use case or complexity
{% endif %}

{% if product_type == "code_snippets" %}
- Include working, tested code examples
- Add comments and explanations
- Provide installation/setup instructions
- Include error handling and debugging tips
{% endif %}

{% if product_type == "notion_template" %}
- Focus on Notion-specific features
- Include database structure and relationships
- Provide setup and customization instructions
- Add automation and integration tips
{% endif %}

## Final Requirements
- **Word Count**: {{ word_count_target }} words (minimum {{ word_count_target * 0.8 }})
- **Tone**: Professional, authoritative, helpful
- **Persona**: Kade - expert digital product creator
- **Format**: Well-structured with clear headings
- **Quality**: Comprehensive, actionable, valuable
- **No**: Personal anecdotes, AI identity disclosure, placeholder text

## Output Format
Generate the {{ section_name }} section following all requirements above. Ensure the content is complete, well-structured, and provides genuine value to the target audience.
